[2026-10-01T22:16:07.924Z] INFO faser.utils_med: If someone is having an asthma attack without their inhaler, first aid can help. Assist them to sit upright and calmly reassure them. If the attack worsens, dial 999 for an ambulance, and avoid exposing them to cold air. Always follow local emergency protocols and legislation.
