[2026-10-01T22:16:22.756Z] INFO faser.utils_med: If someone has a nosebleed, first ensure they are sitting with their head slightly forward to allow the blood to drain. Then, instruct them to pinch the soft part of their nose firmly with their thumb and index finger for about 10 minutes or until the bleeding stops. Advise them to breathe through their mouth during this time and avoid blowing their nose for a few hours to prevent another nosebleed.

