Stay Safe : If you come upon an individual who may need CPR, look around and 
make sure you and the victim are in a safe place . If the victim is in water or on a 
road, try to move the victim to a safer area.  If you are in a safe area, do not try to 
move the victim as he/she may have other injuries that you cannot see.  Simply roll 
him over onto his back. Make sure the victim is on a firm surface, in case 
compressions are needed. 
 
